## 5. Router / Active Agent Identity

### 5.1 Tool Lookup Verification

```python
# Phase 40: Look up from global assistant_agent.tools
from agent import assistant_agent
wrapper = None
for t in getattr(assistant_agent, "tools", []) or []:
    if getattr(t, "name", "") == tool_name:
